-- החלטת ועדת ההיגוי מיום 28.5.2013 לפי סעיף 59 להסכם עוז לתמורה: the
-- steering committee of the Oz LaTmura agreement of 14.8.2011 ("הסכם
-- הרפורמה") amends it, in nineteen sections. Joining the reform: a third
-- of a position counted on the year before joining (§1), a doctor teaching
-- one of five subjects (§2), a teacher completing a teaching certificate
-- (§3), interns (§15), and grades 13–14 kept out until תשע"ה (§18). Roles:
-- homeroom teachers and counsellors spared §7(ט)'s threshold in תשע"ג–
-- תשע"ד (§4), a deputy under §17(1)(ב) paid (1)(א)'s allowance (§7), a new
-- table of the frontal hours a role holder still teaches (§8), the
-- special-education allowance's position (§9) and new evaluation points
-- (§10). The work week (§5): hours counted from the clock, an early start,
-- late work for special facilities, a two-month average, months of reduced
-- and increased work. Pay: the hour value with age hours (§6), the
-- principals' transition supplement and a new "תוספת 87' – מעבר לרפורמה"
-- (§11), a new principal paid as an existing one (§12), the caps of a
-- mother and of any teacher in part application (§§13–14), the one-time
-- grant on a whole sabbatical (§16), contributions on pay beyond a full
-- position (§17), and §28's rates reaching the 1987 and 1994 supplements
-- (§19).
--
-- An amendment encodes what it changes, dated, and imports the rest: the
-- founding agreement's sections are `oz-founding-<N>`, and where this
-- decision replaces one of their rules the rule below is the new one, with
-- the day it governs from, and calls the founding rule for the time before.
-- Nothing here is copied from the founding agreement. When each change
-- governs from is the decision's own words: two sections date themselves
-- from תשע"ב (§5(ב), §6(ג)), some name their years (§§4, 13, 14, 18), the
-- one-time grant of §16 was paid in 2011, and the rest give no day — those
-- govern from the decision's day (convention dates.undated-amendment;
-- F-oz-higui-2013-b).
--
-- The decision speaks to no pay item of l4/lib/vocabulary.l4, as the
-- agreement it amends does not, and is not in oz-latmura-root.l4.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-4`
IMPORT `oz-founding-6`
IMPORT `oz-founding-7`
IMPORT `oz-founding-9`
IMPORT `oz-founding-12`
IMPORT `oz-founding-14`
IMPORT `oz-founding-15`
IMPORT `oz-founding-16`
IMPORT `oz-founding-17`
IMPORT `oz-founding-20`
IMPORT `oz-founding-24`
IMPORT `oz-founding-25`
IMPORT `oz-founding-26`
IMPORT `oz-founding-27`
IMPORT `oz-founding-28`
IMPORT `oz-founding-31`
IMPORT `oz-founding-32`
IMPORT `oz-founding-38`
IMPORT `oz-founding-39`
IMPORT `oz-founding-40`
IMPORT `oz-founding-46`
IMPORT `oz-founding-59`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-b`
IMPORT `oz-founding-annex-g`

-- What the decision lets or has the parties do.
DECLARE `2013 steering decision action` IS ONE OF
    `set the teacher's working day to start before 8:00`
    `work after 17:00 for want of special facilities`
    `prepare a plan of reduced and increased months`

§ `החלטת ועדת ההיגוי של עוז לתמורה — 28.5.2013`

-- akn:preamble The decision's frame: a label row with no text of its own.

-- ¶1: the title, its day handwritten (28.5.13).
@ref akn:preamble/p1
`the 2013 steering decision was taken on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 28 5 2013

-- The day a school year opens, by the calendar year it opens in
-- (convention dates.school-year): תשע"ד opens on 1.9.2013.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `the day the Oz school year opens` y IS
    DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 y

-- A section of the decision that names no day of its own governs from the
-- decision's day, and is checked against the event it governs (convention
-- dates.undated-amendment): a day of work or of pay, the day points fall
-- due, the opening of the school year a teacher joins in.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs on` d IF
    d `is on or after` `the 2013 steering decision was taken on`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs the school year` y IF
    `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs on` (`the day the Oz school year opens` y)

-- ¶2: the steering committee, "בתוקף סמכותה לפי סעיף 59" of the
-- agreement, discussed the parties' proposals "לביצוע שינויים בהסכם
-- הרפורמה" and decided. §59(א) (imported) sets the committee up to help
-- interpret and apply the agreement, to follow its carrying out and to
-- decide disputes over them; it names no power to change the agreement,
-- and §59(ב) wants the consent of the Ministry's and the Treasury's
-- representatives, which the decision, signed by the parties alone, does
-- not record (F-oz-higui-2013-a). The reading adopted: the decision binds
-- as the parties signed it — all the parties to the agreement, every
-- member of the committee — and no rule below is conditioned on the
-- committee's power.
@ref akn:preamble/p2
DECLARE `power section 59(א) gives the Oz steering committee` IS ONE OF
    `helping interpret the agreement`
    `helping apply the agreement`
    `following the agreement's carrying out`
    `deciding disputes over the agreement's interpretation and application`
    `changing the agreement`

`the powers section 59(א) names` MEANS
    LIST `helping interpret the agreement`, `helping apply the agreement`, `following the agreement's carrying out`, `deciding disputes over the agreement's interpretation and application`

`what the 2013 decision says it does under section 59` MEANS `changing the agreement`

-- §59(ב): whether the Ministry's and the Treasury's representatives
-- consented is a fact the decision does not record.
GIVEN `the Ministry's representatives consented` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Treasury's representatives consented` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2013 decision is the Oz steering committee's under section 59(ב)` `the Ministry's representatives consented` `the Treasury's representatives consented` IF
    `the Oz steering committee decides`
        (all (GIVEN p YIELD elem p `the 2013 decision's signatories`) `the members of the Oz steering committee`)
        `the Ministry's representatives consented`
        `the Treasury's representatives consented`

-- §59(ג): at a local authority, a change in pay stands only as §29 of the
-- Budget Foundations Law lets it; the decision carries no approval on its
-- face, so whether one was given is a fact of the case.
GIVEN `as agreed or practised for all state employees` IS A BOOLEAN
      `approved by the Finance Minister` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2013 decision's changes in pay stand at a local authority` `as agreed or practised for all state employees` `approved by the Finance Minister` IF
    `a steering committee decision on pay stands under section 59` TRUE `as agreed or practised for all state employees` `approved by the Finance Minister`

-- F-oz-higui-2013-a's evidence: what the decision says it does is not
-- among the powers §59(א) names, and it is signed by every member of the
-- committee.
`the 2013 decision changes the agreement under a section that names no power to change it` MEANS
        NOT elem `what the 2013 decision says it does under section 59` `the powers section 59(א) names`
    AND all (GIVEN p YIELD elem p `the 2013 decision's signatories`) `the members of the Oz steering committee`
#ASSERT `the 2013 decision changes the agreement under a section that names no power to change it`
#ASSERT `the 2013 decision is the Oz steering committee's under section 59(ב)` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the 2013 decision is the Oz steering committee's under section 59(ב)` TRUE FALSE

§§ `1 עמידה בתנאי סף של שליש משרה לצורך הצטרפות לרפורמה`

-- The subjects §2 names, and any other.
DECLARE `upper-division subject` IS ONE OF
    `mathematics`
    `physics`
    `biology`
    `chemistry`
    `English`
    `another subject`

@desc A teaching employee in the school year he is to join the reform, with what §§1–3, 15 and 18 of the 2013 decision ask.
DECLARE `Oz teacher joining under the 2013 decision` HAS
    `qualifications`                                   IS A `Oz teaching employee's qualifications` @desc the position share is with all the employers, grades 13–14 included (§18(ב))
    `an existing teaching employee`                    IS A BOOLEAN @desc §4(ג) of the agreement
    `the school year of joining`                       IS A NUMBER  @desc by the calendar year it opens in: 2013 is תשע"ד
    `upper-division position in the year before joining` IS A NUMBER
    `upper-division position in the year of joining`   IS A NUMBER
    `holds a doctorate`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `the subject he teaches in the upper division`     IS AN `upper-division subject`
    `in an internship year`                            IS A BOOLEAN @desc in his year of internship in teaching (סטאז')
    `lacks a licence only for want of a teaching certificate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `held on the eve of the year a permit letter from the teaching personnel division` IS A BOOLEAN @desc "כתב היתר" for completing a permanent teaching licence
    `registered on the eve of the year for the studies the letter sets` IS A BOOLEAN
    `signed on the eve of the year the commitment to complete them in three years` IS A BOOLEAN

-- ¶1–¶2: for §§6(ב) and 7(ח), an existing teaching employee counts as
-- employed at a third of a position also where, in the school year before
-- he joined, he was employed in the upper division at a third of a
-- position at least ("לפחות": a third is in), and in the year he joined,
-- below a third. The section is undated: it governs a teacher joining in a
-- school year that opens after the decision's day (convention
-- dates.undated-amendment), תשע"ד on. §6(ב) speaks of new teaching
-- employees only, and §1 of existing ones (F-oz-higui-2013-c): the reading
-- adopted, as printed (convention reading.as-printed), is that §1 works
-- through §7(ח) (and through it §5(ב)'s count), and that its mention of
-- §6(ב) reaches no one.
@ref akn:art_1/p1 akn:art_1/p2
GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher joining under the 2013 decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `counted at a third of a position by section 1 of the 2013 decision` t IF
        t's `an existing teaching employee`
    AND `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs the school year` (t's `the school year of joining`)
    AND t's `upper-division position in the year before joining` AT LEAST 1/3
    AND t's `upper-division position in the year of joining` LESS THAN 1/3

GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher joining under the 2013 decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `below a third of a position, as the 2013 decision counts it` t IF
        `employed below a third of a position` (t's `qualifications`)
    AND NOT `counted at a third of a position by section 1 of the 2013 decision` t

-- The licence-and-degree half of §§6(ב) and 7(ח)(2), as the founding
-- agreement writes it (imported): the founding rule asked of the same
-- teacher at a full position, which takes the third-of-a-position half out.
GIVEN q IS AN `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
GIVETH AN `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
DECIDE `the same qualifications at a full position` q IS
    `Oz teaching employee's qualifications` WITH
        `position share with the employers, in all` IS 1
        `entitled to a permanent teaching licence or a licence to teach` IS q's `entitled to a permanent teaching licence or a licence to teach`
        `holds an academic degree` IS q's `holds an academic degree`
        `teaches a field with no relevant academic education, with a permit` IS q's `teaches a field with no relevant academic education, with a permit`
        `holds technological education relevant to the field taught` IS q's `holds technological education relevant to the field taught`

GIVEN q IS AN `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 7(ח)(2) bars him` q IF
    `section 7(ח) keeps the existing teaching employee off the reform` (`the same qualifications at a full position` q)

GIVEN q IS AN `Oz teaching employee's qualifications`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 6(ב)'s licence and degree bar takes him out` q IF
    `section 6(ב) takes the new teaching employee out of (א)` (`the same qualifications at a full position` q)

§§ `2 הצטרפות לרפורמה — עובד הוראה בעל תואר שלישי (ד"ר)`

-- After §7(ח)(2)(ב) comes (ג): one with a doctorate who teaches in the
-- upper division mathematics, physics, biology, chemistry or English is
-- saved from (2)'s bar, as one without a licence. A closed list (convention
-- reading.closed-list). Only §7(ח) is amended: a new teacher with a
-- doctorate and no licence is still out by §6(ב), which §2 does not touch
-- (§15 amends both). Undated: from the decision's day.
@ref akn:art_2/p1
`the subjects section 7(ח)(2)(ג) names` MEANS
    LIST `mathematics`, `physics`, `biology`, `chemistry`, `English`

GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher joining under the 2013 decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 7(ח)(2)(ג) saves a doctor` t IF
        t's `holds a doctorate`
    AND elem (t's `the subject he teaches in the upper division`) `the subjects section 7(ח)(2)(ג) names`

§§ `3 הצטרפות לרפורמה — השלמת תעודת הוראה`

-- (א): after §7(ח) comes (ח1): notwithstanding (ח)(2), a teaching employee
-- not entitled to a permanent licence because he is not entitled to a
-- teaching certificate may be employed on the reform's terms, and §7
-- applies to him, provided that on the eve of the school year he is to
-- start on them he (1) held a permit letter for completing the licence
-- from the Ministry's teaching personnel division, (2) had registered for
-- the studies it sets, and (3) had signed a commitment to complete them,
-- and every duty in them, within three years of receiving the letter. The
-- conditions are cumulative (convention reading.lists). (ח1) speaks of the
-- licence alone: one without an academic degree is still barred by (ח)(2).
-- What follows if the studies are not completed in three years the
-- decision does not say; the letter that sets them is outside the corpus.
@ref akn:art_3__para_a
GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher joining under the 2013 decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 7(ח1) lets him join` t IF
        t's `lacks a licence only for want of a teaching certificate`
    AND (t's `qualifications`)'s `holds an academic degree`
    AND t's `held on the eve of the year a permit letter from the teaching personnel division`
    AND t's `registered on the eve of the year for the studies the letter sets`
    AND t's `signed on the eve of the year the commitment to complete them in three years`

`the years section 7(ח1) gives to complete the studies` MEANS 3

`why the terms of the permit letter are not here` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "כתב ההיתר של אגף כוח אדם בהוראה במשרד החינוך לעניין השלמת רישיון הוראה קבוע, והלימודים שהוא קובע"

-- (ב): "למען הסר ספק", nothing in the section changes the other rules that
-- apply to one not entitled to a teaching certificate or licence.
@ref akn:art_3__para_b
`section 3 of the 2013 decision changes the other rules on one without a certificate or licence` MEANS FALSE

§§ `1–3, 15, 18 — who joins`

-- §7(ח) as the decision leaves it, for a teacher joining in a school year
-- it governs: below a third of a position as §1 counts it, or barred by
-- (2) and saved by none of (2)(ג) (§2), (2)(ד) (§15(ב)) or (ח1) (§3). For
-- a year before, the founding §7(ח) (imported).
@ref akn:art_1/p1 akn:art_2/p1 akn:art_3__para_a akn:art_15__para_b
GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher joining under the 2013 decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 7(ח) keeps him off the reform, as the 2013 decision amends it` t IF
    IF `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs the school year` (t's `the school year of joining`)
    THEN    `below a third of a position, as the 2013 decision counts it` t
         OR (    `section 7(ח)(2) bars him` (t's `qualifications`)
             AND NOT `section 7(ח)(2)(ג) saves a doctor` t
             AND NOT `section 7(ח)(2)(ד) saves an intern` t
             AND NOT `section 7(ח1) lets him join` t)
    ELSE `section 7(ח) keeps the existing teaching employee off the reform` (t's `qualifications`)

-- §6(ב) as §15(א) leaves it: below a third, or without a licence or a
-- degree save in a field with no academic education — or, now, as one with
-- a degree in his internship year.
@ref akn:art_15__para_a
GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher joining under the 2013 decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 6(ב) takes him out of (א), as the 2013 decision amends it` t IF
    IF `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs the school year` (t's `the school year of joining`)
    THEN    `employed below a third of a position` (t's `qualifications`)
         OR (    `section 6(ב)'s licence and degree bar takes him out` (t's `qualifications`)
             AND NOT `an intern with a degree, by section 15 of the 2013 decision` t)
    ELSE `section 6(ב) takes the new teaching employee out of (א)` (t's `qualifications`)

§§ `4 תפקיד של מחנך כיתה או יועץ חינוכי בשנות הלימודים תשע"ג ותשע"ד`

-- Notwithstanding §7(ט), in the school years תשע"ג and תשע"ד being employed
-- on the reform's terms is no threshold condition for the role of a
-- homeroom teacher or of an educational counsellor. The section names its
-- years: it reaches back to תשע"ג.
@ref akn:art_4/p1
GIVEN t IS AN `Oz existing teaching employee's year`, r IS AN `Oz role`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets section 7(ט)'s threshold for the role, as the 2013 decision amends it` t r IF
       `meets section 7(ט)'s threshold for a role` t
    OR (    (r EQUALS `the Oz homeroom teacher` OR r EQUALS `the Oz educational counsellor`)
        AND (t's `the school year` EQUALS `the school year 5773` OR t's `the school year` EQUALS `the school year 5774`))

§§ `5 מבנה שבוע העבודה ברפורמה`

-- (ב): (א)(1) to (א)(3), and only they, take effect in the school year
-- תשע"ב; (א)(4) names no day and governs from the decision's day
-- (convention dates.undated-amendment).
@ref akn:art_5__para_b
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 5(א)(1)–(3) of the 2013 decision governs on` d IF
    d `is on or after` (`the day the Oz school year opens` `the school year 5772`)

-- akn:art_5__para_a The opening of (א), "in §9 of the agreement"; its paragraphs are below.

-- (א)(1): after §9(ב) come (ב1) and (ב2). (ב1): a teaching employee's
-- hours are counted from his clocking in, but not before 7:45, subject to
-- (ב2) and to §9(ג)'s prayer. (ב2): at the teacher's request before the
-- school year or a half-year, the principal may set his day to start before
-- 8:00, but not before 7:00; his hours are then counted from his clocking
-- in, but not before the start set, and the hours before 8:00 are placed in
-- his timetable as teaching-support hours. Hours are numbers of the clock,
-- as in §9 (7.75 is 7:45). Where the prayer has him start before 7:45,
-- §9(ג) (imported) sets the earlier hour.
@ref akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_1
`the earliest hour (ב1) counts from` MEANS 7.75

GIVEN d IS A `day of the Oz week`
      `clocked in at` IS A NUMBER
      `required at the morning prayer` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the prayer starts at` IS A NUMBER
      `the start the principal set` IS A MAYBE NUMBER @desc (ב2): an hour from 7:00 to before 8:00, at the teacher's request
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hour his working day is counted from under (ב1)` d `clocked in at` `required at the morning prayer` `the prayer starts at` `the start the principal set` IS
    max `clocked in at` floor
    WHERE
        floor MEANS
            CONSIDER `the start the principal set`
            WHEN JUST s THEN s
            WHEN NOTHING THEN
                IF `required at the morning prayer`
                THEN min `the earliest hour (ב1) counts from` (`the hour the working day starts` d TRUE `the prayer starts at`)
                ELSE `the earliest hour (ב1) counts from`

GIVEN `the teacher asked before the year or the half-year` IS A BOOLEAN, `the start asked for` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2013 steering decision action`
DECIDE `setting an early start under (ב2)` `the teacher asked before the year or the half-year` `the start asked for` IS
    IF      `the teacher asked before the year or the half-year`
        AND `the start asked for` AT LEAST 7
        AND `the start asked for` LESS THAN 8
    THEN PARTY `the school principal`
         MAY   `set the teacher's working day to start before 8:00`
    ELSE FULFILLED

GIVEN `the start set` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours before 8:00 placed as teaching-support hours` `the start set` IS
    max 0 (8 MINUS `the start set`)

-- (א)(2): after §9(ה) comes (ה1): teaching employees whose work needs
-- special facilities not at their disposal so as to do all their hours
-- between 8:00 and 17:00 (a dance hall, an editing room, a stage, a
-- laboratory and the like) may work after 17:00 too, provided they work no
-- more than 9 hours in a day ("לא יותר מ־9": 9 is in).
@ref akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN `needs facilities not at hand from 8:00 to 17:00` IS A BOOLEAN, `hours worked that day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `2013 steering decision action`
DECIDE `working after 17:00 under (ה1)` `needs facilities not at hand from 8:00 to 17:00` `hours worked that day` IS
    IF `needs facilities not at hand from 8:00 to 17:00` AND `hours worked that day` AT MOST 9
    THEN PARTY `the teaching employee`
         MAY   `work after 17:00 for want of special facilities`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- (א)(3): in §9(ז), "on a two-monthly average" for "on a monthly
-- average": the mix of the support activities may move from week to week,
-- by the principal's decision or approval, so long as over two months the
-- weekly average is §9(ו)'s. The founding rule (imported) is asked of the
-- two months' average.
@ref akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_3
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `every week keeps (ו)'s mix` IS A BOOLEAN
      `decided or approved by the principal` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the period's weekly average for` IS A FUNCTION FROM `Oz teaching-support activity` TO NUMBER @desc over two months from (ב)'s day, over the month before it
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the teaching-support mix is allowed, as the 2013 decision amends section 9(ז), on` d `every week keeps (ו)'s mix` `decided or approved by the principal` `the period's weekly average for` IF
    `the month's teaching-support mix is allowed` `every week keeps (ו)'s mix` `decided or approved by the principal` `the period's weekly average for`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the months section 9(ז)'s average runs over on` d IS
    IF `section 5(א)(1)–(3) of the 2013 decision governs on` d THEN 2 ELSE 1

-- (א)(4): after §9(י) comes (י1). (1): where the principal finds that in
-- some months of the school year more work than the position asks is
-- needed ("עבודה מוגברת"), he may, with the teacher's agreement, prepare a
-- plan by which, in earlier months of that school year — no more than one
-- month for each month of increased work — the teacher does fewer support
-- hours than his position asks ("עבודה מופחתת"), and in their place more in
-- the months of increased work; all of it so long as he works no more than
-- 9 hours a day and 43 a week ("למעלה מ־": 9 and 43 are in, convention
-- thresholds.above). (2): his monthly salary does not change for the plan;
-- what is paid for the hours not done in the months of reduced work is an
-- advance on the months of increased work. (3): the teacher signs his
-- consent to the plan and to the advance. Months are counted in the school
-- year from September (1) to August (12).
@ref akn:art_5__para_a__subpara_4
@desc A plan of reduced and increased months under (י1).
DECLARE `Oz plan of reduced and increased months` HAS
    `the principal finds more work is needed in some months` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the teacher agrees`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `months of reduced work`                IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc in the school year, September 1 to August 12
    `months of increased work`              IS A LIST OF NUMBER
    `most hours it asks in a day`           IS A NUMBER
    `most hours it asks in a week`          IS A NUMBER
    `the teacher signed his consent to the plan and the advance` IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN d IS A DATE, p IS AN `Oz plan of reduced and increased months`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2013 decision allows the plan on` d p IF
        `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs on` d
    AND p's `the principal finds more work is needed in some months`
    AND p's `the teacher agrees`
    AND p's `the teacher signed his consent to the plan and the advance`
    AND NOT null (p's `months of increased work`)
    AND all (GIVEN m YIELD m LESS THAN minimum (p's `months of increased work`)) (p's `months of reduced work`)
    AND count (p's `months of reduced work`) AT MOST count (p's `months of increased work`)
    AND NOT (p's `most hours it asks in a day` `is above` 9)
    AND NOT (p's `most hours it asks in a week` `is above` 43)

-- (2): the month's salary is the position's, plan or no plan.
GIVEN `the month's salary by his position` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the month's salary under a plan of (י1)` `the month's salary by his position` IS
    `the month's salary by his position`

§§ `6 חישוב ערך שעה לעובד הוראה הזכאי להפחתת שעות בשל גיל`

-- (א): after §15(ב) comes (ג): for a teaching employee entitled to fewer
-- hours for his age (§12), the hours in the hour value's divisor — 40, or
-- 24 off the reform — are reduced by the reduction he is entitled to. (ב):
-- §32 replaces those hours "in §§15(ב) and 15(ג)", so in part application
-- its 30/32/36 (a teacher) and 37/38/39 (a principal's hour of absence) are
-- reduced too. (ג): from the school year תשע"ב. Before it, §15(ב) and §32
-- as signed (imported).
@ref akn:art_6__para_a akn:art_6__para_b akn:art_6__para_c
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 6 of the 2013 decision governs the school year` y IF
    y AT LEAST `the school year 5772`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `the base of a full position` IS A NUMBER, `the age reduction by the rules` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz hour value, as section 15(ג) reduces it` y `the base of a full position` `the age reduction by the rules` IS
    IF `section 6 of the 2013 decision governs the school year` y
    THEN `the base of a full position` DIVIDED BY (`weeks in a month, for the hour value` TIMES (40 MINUS `the age reduction by the rules`))
    ELSE `the Oz hour value` `the base of a full position`

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `the base of a full position off the reform` IS A NUMBER, `the age reduction by the rules` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hour value off the Oz reform, as section 15(ג) reduces it` y `the base of a full position off the reform` `the age reduction by the rules` IS
    IF `section 6 of the 2013 decision governs the school year` y
    THEN `the base of a full position off the reform` DIVIDED BY (`weeks in a month, for the hour value` TIMES (24 MINUS `the age reduction by the rules`))
    ELSE `the hour value off the Oz reform from 5772` `the base of a full position off the reform`

GIVEN k IS A `whose hour value section 32 changes`, use IS A `what the Oz hour value is for`, y IS A NUMBER
      `the base of a full position` IS A NUMBER
      `the age reduction by the rules` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the hour value in part application, as section 15(ג) reduces it` k use y `the base of a full position` `the age reduction by the rules` IS
    IF `section 6 of the 2013 decision governs the school year` y
    THEN `the base of a full position` DIVIDED BY (`weeks in a month, for the hour value` TIMES (hours MINUS `the age reduction by the rules`))
    ELSE `the hour value in part application` k use y `the base of a full position`
    WHERE
        hours MEANS fromMaybe 40 (`the hours section 32 puts in place of 40 for` k use y)

§§ `7 גמול אחוזי לסגן מנהל`

-- Notwithstanding §17's table, in its "תגמול" column for a deputy
-- principal, (1)(ב), and so long as the parties have not agreed otherwise,
-- a deputy principal in whom (1)(א) is not met is entitled to the
-- percentage allowance of a deputy in whom it is: the rate by the rules of
-- the eve of the signing, on (1)(א)'s base (imported). Undated: it governs
-- the allowance for a day from the decision's day (convention
-- dates.undated-amendment); before it, §17 (imported) sets no figure for
-- such a deputy (annex ד' was never published).
@ref akn:art_7/p1
GIVEN d IS A DATE, h IS A `Oz role holder`, `the parties agreed otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the section 17 allowance rate, as the 2013 decision amends it, on` d h `the parties agreed otherwise` IS
    IF      h's `the role` EQUALS `the Oz deputy principal`
        AND NOT `the deputy keeps the eve rules' allowance` h
        AND `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs on` d
        AND NOT `the parties agreed otherwise`
    THEN JUST (h's `the rate by the rules on the eve of the signing`)
    ELSE `the section 17 allowance rate` h

GIVEN h IS A `Oz role holder`, b IS A `Oz role allowance base`, `the parties agreed otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the section 17 role allowance, as the 2013 decision amends it` h b `the parties agreed otherwise` IS
    CONSIDER `the section 17 allowance rate, as the 2013 decision amends it, on` (b's `the day`) h `the parties agreed otherwise`
    WHEN JUST rate THEN JUST (rate TIMES `the section 17 allowance base` (h's `the role`) b)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

§§ `8 מכסה מינימאלית של שעות הוראה פרונטאלית לבעלי תפקיד`

-- akn:art_8/p1 The opening, "in §17 of the agreement"; its paragraphs are below.

-- (א)(1)–(4): in §17(א)'s table, the floors the rows set themselves — a
-- deputy's 9 in (2)(א) and (2)(ג)(3), the grade and social-education
-- coordinators' 12, the counsellor's 8 in (2)(א) — become "not fewer than
-- §17(ד) says". (ב): in place of §17(ד), a table: the weekly frontal hours
-- (in fact) a role holder teaches are not fewer than its row says — at a
-- full position a number of hours; at a position not full, or for one
-- entitled to age hours, a share of the frontal hours the work-week tables
-- set for him, and in any case not fewer than a number of hours ("ובכל
-- מקרה לא פחות מ־": the text sets the floor on purpose, even where it is
-- more than his position's frontal hours). The share is not rounded
-- (convention rounding.default). Undated: from the decision's day.
@ref akn:art_8__para_a akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_8__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_8__para_b
@desc A row of §17(ד)'s table as the 2013 decision writes it.
DECLARE `row of the 2013 table of frontal hours` HAS
    `hours at a full position`         IS A NUMBER
    `share of the tables' frontal hours otherwise` IS A NUMBER
    `and in any case at least`         IS A NUMBER

GIVEN full IS A NUMBER, share IS A NUMBER, least IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `row of the 2013 table of frontal hours`
DECIDE `a 2013 frontal-hours row of` full share least IS
    `row of the 2013 table of frontal hours` WITH
        `hours at a full position`         IS full
        `share of the tables' frontal hours otherwise` IS share
        `and in any case at least`         IS least

-- The rows, in the table's order: the counsellor, the deputy, the homeroom
-- teacher, the grade, subject and social-education coordinators, the
-- adjustments coordinator ("רכז התאמות למידה והבחנות בבחינות הבגרות"), the
-- evaluation and measurement coordinator, and any role holder not listed.
GIVEN r IS AN `Oz role`
GIVETH A `row of the 2013 table of frontal hours`
DECIDE `the 2013 frontal-hours row for` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `the Oz educational counsellor` THEN `a 2013 frontal-hours row of` 8 (33%) 4
    WHEN `the Oz deputy principal` THEN `a 2013 frontal-hours row of` 9 (33%) 6
    WHEN `the Oz homeroom teacher` THEN `a 2013 frontal-hours row of` 12 (50%) 6
    WHEN `the Oz grade coordinator` THEN `a 2013 frontal-hours row of` 12 (50%) 6
    WHEN `the Oz subject coordinator` THEN `a 2013 frontal-hours row of` 12 (50%) 8
    WHEN `the Oz social-education coordinator` THEN `a 2013 frontal-hours row of` 12 (50%) 8
    WHEN `the Oz adjustments coordinator` THEN `a 2013 frontal-hours row of` 12 (50%) 8
    WHEN `the Oz measurement and evaluation coordinator` THEN `a 2013 frontal-hours row of` 12 (50%) 8
    OTHERWISE `a 2013 frontal-hours row of` 12 (50%) 10

GIVEN r IS AN `Oz role`
      `at a full position, with no age hours` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the frontal hours the work-week tables set for him` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the frontal hours a role holder teaches at least under the 2013 decision` r `at a full position, with no age hours` `the frontal hours the work-week tables set for him` IS
    IF `at a full position, with no age hours`
    THEN row's `hours at a full position`
    ELSE max (row's `and in any case at least`)
             (row's `share of the tables' frontal hours otherwise` TIMES `the frontal hours the work-week tables set for him`)
    WHERE
        row MEANS `the 2013 frontal-hours row for` r

-- The floor on a day: §17(ד) and the rows as signed (imported) before the
-- decision's day, the table after it.
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      r IS AN `Oz role`
      `at a full position, with no age hours` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the frontal hours the work-week tables set for him` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the frontal hours a role holder teaches at least on` d r `at a full position, with no age hours` `the frontal hours the work-week tables set for him` IS
    IF `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs on` d
    THEN `the frontal hours a role holder teaches at least under the 2013 decision` r `at a full position, with no age hours` `the frontal hours the work-week tables set for him`
    ELSE `the frontal hours a role holder teaches at least` r

§§ `9 חישוב גמול חינוך מיוחד`

-- After §17(ג) comes (ג1): the position on which a teaching employee is
-- paid the special-education allowance (which §17(ג)(2) keeps) is the
-- frontal hours he teaches in fact in special-education classes divided by
-- the frontal hours of a full position for him, as annex ב' (a teacher
-- entitled to the age reduction) and annex ג' set them at 100%: the first
-- column of the table for his age band (imported). Undated: from the
-- decision's day; before it, the rules of the eve of the signing, which
-- §17(ג) keeps (an input).
@ref akn:art_9/p1
GIVEN band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the frontal hours of a full position for section 17(ג1)` band IS
    CONSIDER `the week of the annexed table's full position` (fromMaybe `the table of annex ג'` (`the table of annex ב' for` band))
    WHEN JUST w THEN w's `frontal teaching hours`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the Oz full-position week`'s `frontal teaching hours`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      band IS AN `Oz annexed age band`
      `frontal hours in special-education classes` IS A NUMBER
      `the position by the rules on the eve of the signing` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position the special-education allowance is paid on` d band `frontal hours in special-education classes` `the position by the rules on the eve of the signing` IS
    IF `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs on` d
    THEN `frontal hours in special-education classes` DIVIDED BY `the frontal hours of a full position for section 17(ג1)` band
    ELSE `the position by the rules on the eve of the signing`

§§ `10 צבירת נקודות זכות בגין הערכה`

-- In §20(ב), a new table in place of its own: the 30% of a school's
-- teachers that §20(ב) still names, in two bands of 15% where the table had
-- three of 10% — the top 15%: 4 points to a homeroom teacher, 2.5 to the
-- grade, subject, evaluation, adjustments, social-education and trips
-- coordinators, 5.5 to a teacher who is no role holder; the next 15%: 2, 1
-- and 3.5. A teacher's place and columns are as §20(ב) reads them
-- (imported, F-oz-founding-20-a). Undated: it governs the points that fall
-- due from the decision's day (§20(ג): at the end of the school year), so
-- תשע"ג's points on.
@ref akn:art_10/p1
GIVEN `teachers evaluated above him` IS A NUMBER, `the school's teachers` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the evaluation band of the 2013 table` `teachers evaluated above him` `the school's teachers` IS
    BRANCH
        IF place AT MOST 15% TIMES `the school's teachers` THEN 1
        IF place AT MOST 30% TIMES `the school's teachers` THEN 2
        OTHERWISE 0
    WHERE
        place MEANS `teachers evaluated above him` PLUS 1

GIVEN c IS A `column of section 20(ב)'s table`, band IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the evaluation points in the 2013 table` c band IS
    CONSIDER c
    WHEN `the homeroom teachers' column` THEN
        BRANCH IF band EQUALS 1 THEN 4
               IF band EQUALS 2 THEN 2
               OTHERWISE 0
    WHEN `the coordinators' column` THEN
        BRANCH IF band EQUALS 1 THEN 2.5
               IF band EQUALS 2 THEN 1
               OTHERWISE 0
    WHEN `the column of a teacher who is not a role holder` THEN
        BRANCH IF band EQUALS 1 THEN 5.5
               IF band EQUALS 2 THEN 3.5
               OTHERWISE 0

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      roles IS A LIST OF `Oz role`
      `teachers evaluated above him` IS A NUMBER
      `the school's teachers` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the evaluation points of the year, as the 2013 decision amends section 20(ב)` y roles `teachers evaluated above him` `the school's teachers` IS
    IF `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs on` (`the day the points are due for school year` y)
    THEN IF y AT LEAST `the school year 5773`
         THEN maximum (0 FOLLOWED BY map (GIVEN c YIELD `the evaluation points in the 2013 table` c band) (`the columns a teacher's roles put him in` roles))
         ELSE 0
    ELSE `the evaluation points of the year` y roles `teachers evaluated above him` `the school's teachers`
    WHERE
        band MEANS `the evaluation band of the 2013 table` `teachers evaluated above him` `the school's teachers`

§§ `11 תוספת מעבר לרפורמה`

-- akn:art_11/p1 The opening, "in §24 of the agreement"; its paragraphs are below.

@desc The components a principal's transition supplement is computed on under the 2013 decision, at his own values, on a day.
DECLARE `Oz principal's components under the 2013 decision` HAS
    `the day`                 IS A DATE
    `the combined salary`     IS A NUMBER
    `the 1987 supplement`     IS A NUMBER
    `the 1994 supplement`     IS A NUMBER
    `the 2001 supplement`     IS A NUMBER
    `the 2008 supplement`     IS A NUMBER

GIVEN c IS AN `Oz principal's components under the 2013 decision`
GIVETH AN `Oz principal's salary components`
DECIDE `the components section 24(א) names, of` c IS
    `Oz principal's salary components` WITH
        `the combined salary` IS c's `the combined salary`
        `the 1994 supplement` IS c's `the 1994 supplement`
        `the 2001 supplement` IS c's `the 2001 supplement`
        `the 2008 supplement` IS c's `the 2008 supplement`

-- (א): in §24(א), the base of the transition supplement becomes the
-- combined salary and the 1994, 2001, 2008, 2011 and 2011 erosion
-- supplements: the two that §§38(ג) and 39(ב) bring into every percentage
-- supplement and (א)'s list had left out (F-oz-founding-24-b). The 2011
-- supplement and the erosion supplement are §§38 and 39's on the
-- principal's own components (imported). Undated: from the decision's day.
@ref akn:art_11__para_a
GIVEN c IS AN `Oz principal's components under the 2013 decision`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the transition supplement's base under the 2013 decision` c IS
    c's `the combined salary` PLUS c's `the 1994 supplement` PLUS c's `the 2001 supplement` PLUS c's `the 2008 supplement` PLUS added
    WHERE
        added MEANS
            IF `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs on` (c's `the day`)
            THEN `the 2011 supplement under section 38` (c's `the day`) (c's `the combined salary`) (c's `the 2001 supplement`) (c's `the 2008 supplement`)
                 PLUS `the erosion supplement under section 39` (c's `the day`) (c's `the combined salary`) (c's `the 1987 supplement`) (c's `the 1994 supplement`) (c's `the 2008 supplement`) (c's `the 2001 supplement`)
            ELSE 0

-- (ב): at the end of §24(ג): "כמו כן, בגין תוספת מעבר לרפורמה יבוצעו
-- הפרשות לקרן השתלמות". From the decision's day the transition supplement
-- carries training-fund contributions too (F-oz-founding-24-a); before it,
-- what §24 brings it into account for (imported).
@ref akn:art_11__para_b
GIVEN d IS A DATE, p IS A `what an Oz salary component counts for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the transition supplement counts, as the 2013 decision amends section 24(ג), on` d p IF
       `section 24 brings the transition supplement into account for` p
    OR (    `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs on` d
        AND p EQUALS `contributions to a training fund`)

-- (ג): after §24(ג) comes (ג1): an existing principal is entitled, besides
-- the 1987 supplement, to "תוספת 87' – מעבר לרפורמה", the 1987 supplement
-- times 50%, and the rules of the 1987 supplement for an existing
-- principal, save its amount, apply to it. (ג1) says "מנהל קיים" without
-- (א)'s "המכהן בבית ספר בו מיושמת הרפורמה" (F-oz-higui-2013-f): the
-- reading adopted (convention reading.consistent) is that it goes with the
-- transition supplement it is named for and is inserted beside — to an
-- existing principal in a school applying the reform, fully or in part —
-- as with §12 below to a principal paid as one. Undated: from the
-- decision's day.
@ref akn:art_11__para_c
`the 1987 transition supplement's share of the 1987 supplement` MEANS 50%

`why the 1987 supplement's other rules are not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "הכללים החלים על תוספת 87' לגבי מנהל קיים, בהסכמים הקיבוציים (מלבד סכום התוספת)"

§§ `12 תנאי השכר של מנהל חדש`

-- Notwithstanding §§25 and 31(ב), and so long as the parties have not
-- agreed otherwise, a new principal employed on the reform's terms is paid
-- by the rules for an existing principal's pay. Undated: from the
-- decision's day; before it, §25 and §31(ב) as signed (imported;
-- F-oz-founding-31-a, F-oz-founding-25-a).
@ref akn:art_12/p1
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`, d IS A DATE, `the parties agreed otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `paid by the rules for an existing principal, by the 2013 decision` m e d `the parties agreed otherwise` IF
        NOT e EQUALS `off the Oz reform`
    AND (   `an existing principal under the Oz agreement` m
         OR (    `a new principal under the Oz agreement` m
             AND `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs on` d
             AND NOT `the parties agreed otherwise`))

-- §24(א) with §11(א): the transition supplement, 50% of the base above,
-- to a principal paid as an existing one in a school applying the reform.
@ref akn:art_11__para_a akn:art_12/p1
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`, c IS AN `Oz principal's components under the 2013 decision`, `the parties agreed otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the transition supplement under the 2013 decision` m e c `the parties agreed otherwise` IS
    IF `paid by the rules for an existing principal, by the 2013 decision` m e (c's `the day`) `the parties agreed otherwise`
    THEN `the transition supplement rate` TIMES `the transition supplement's base under the 2013 decision` c
    ELSE 0

-- (ג1) with §12: the 1987 transition supplement, from the decision's day.
@ref akn:art_11__para_c akn:art_12/p1
GIVEN m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`, d IS A DATE
      `the 1987 supplement` IS A NUMBER @desc the principal's own
      `the parties agreed otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1987 transition supplement` m e d `the 1987 supplement` `the parties agreed otherwise` IS
    IF      `paid by the rules for an existing principal, by the 2013 decision` m e d `the parties agreed otherwise`
        AND `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs on` d
    THEN `the 1987 transition supplement's share of the 1987 supplement` TIMES `the 1987 supplement`
    ELSE 0

-- §24(ד) and §31(א) with §12: the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals,
-- 30% of the combined salary in a school in full application, §31(א)'s
-- rate of the year in part application (imported), to a principal paid as
-- an existing one.
@ref akn:art_12/p1
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`, c IS AN `Oz principal's components under the 2013 decision`, `the parties agreed otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals under the 2013 decision` y m e c `the parties agreed otherwise` IS
    IF `paid by the rules for an existing principal, by the 2013 decision` m e (c's `the day`) `the parties agreed otherwise`
    THEN BRANCH
            IF e EQUALS `the Oz reform in full`
            THEN `the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals rate` TIMES c's `the combined salary`
            IF `a school of the Oz part application in` y e
            THEN fromMaybe 0 (`the Oz LaTmura supplement for principals rate in part application in` y) TIMES c's `the combined salary`
            OTHERWISE 0
    ELSE 0

§§ `13 מבנה שבוע העבודה של מורה ביישום חלקי של הרפורמה`

-- akn:art_13/p1 The opening, "in §26 of the agreement"; its paragraphs are below.

-- (א): in place of §26(ו): in §11(ד), for a mother in part application,
-- "up to a position of 138.6%" (תשע"ב), "139.3%" (תשע"ג) and "124.6%"
-- (תשע"ד) for 107%: employment under §11 up to that position needs no
-- special approval of the Ministry under §14. Each cap is §27's new
-- greatest position for the year plus §26(ה)'s step, so it is in (an
-- exception to convention thresholds.until, as §26(ו) was). (ב): after
-- (ו) comes (ו1): in תשע"ד, where approval was given under §14(ב), a
-- mother's greatest position is 135.6%. The section prints its years,
-- תשע"ב among them: its words reach back.
@ref akn:art_13__para_a akn:art_13__para_b
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the cap the 2013 decision puts in place of 107% in` y IS
    `by the year of part application` y (138.6%) (139.3%) (124.6%)

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `approved under section 14(ב)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `a mother's cap in part application, as the 2013 decision amends section 26, in` y `approved under section 14(ב)` IS
    IF y EQUALS `the school year 5774` AND `approved under section 14(ב)`
    THEN JUST (135.6%)
    ELSE `the cap the 2013 decision puts in place of 107% in` y

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `approved under section 14(ב)` IS A BOOLEAN, `the position she is paid on` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 26(ו) spares the Ministry's approval, as the 2013 decision amends it, in` y `approved under section 14(ב)` `the position she is paid on` IF
    CONSIDER `a mother's cap in part application, as the 2013 decision amends section 26, in` y `approved under section 14(ב)`
    WHEN JUST cap THEN `the position she is paid on` AT MOST cap
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

§§ `14 היקף העסקה מקסימלי ביישום חלקי של הרפורמה`

-- akn:art_14/p1 The opening, "in §27 of the agreement"; its paragraphs are below.

-- (א): §27's opening paragraph is marked (א). (ב): in place of its table:
-- 130% in תשע"ב, 131% in תשע"ג, 117% in תשע"ד, and a last row with no year,
-- "where approval was given under §14(ב) – 128%". The row stands under
-- תשע"ד, and §13(ב)'s (ו1) gives the mother in תשע"ד with that approval
-- 135.6%, 128% plus תשע"ד's step: it is תשע"ד's. The table prints its
-- years: its words reach back. (א) still says the greatest position "יופחת
-- באופן הדרגתי", where the new table rises from תשע"ב to תשע"ג
-- (F-oz-higui-2013-d): the table's figures govern (convention
-- precedence.table).
@ref akn:art_14__para_a akn:art_14__para_b
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, `approved under section 14(ב)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the most a teacher in part application may be employed at, as the 2013 decision amends section 27, in` y `approved under section 14(ב)` IS
    IF y EQUALS `the school year 5774` AND `approved under section 14(ב)`
    THEN JUST (128%)
    ELSE `by the year of part application` y (130%) (131%) (117%)

-- (ג): after (א) come (ב): the employment beyond 100% that the table
-- allows is in frontal teaching hours only; and (ג): "למען הסר ספק", §14(ד)
-- (pay for hours beyond a full position by a larger position, with a
-- summer share) does not apply to employment beyond 100% in part
-- application. (ד): §27's paragraph beginning "למען הסר ספק" is marked
-- (ד) — the one (ג) did not insert, which is already marked.
@ref akn:art_14__para_c akn:art_14__para_d
`the employment beyond a full position in part application is frontal hours only` MEANS TRUE

GIVEN `in part application` IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A `Oz employment beyond a full position`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 14(ד) pays the hours beyond, as the 2013 decision amends section 27` `in part application` e IF
    (NOT `in part application`) AND `section 14(ד) pays the hours beyond` e

§§ `15 עובד הוראה בשנת התמחות (סטאז')`

-- (א) and (ב): at the end of §6(ב), "and save one with an academic degree
-- in his internship year in teaching"; after §7(ח)(2)(ג), (ד) the same.
-- One with a degree in his internship year is saved from the licence bar.
-- Undated: from the decision's day (the rules above, `section 6(ב) takes
-- him out of (א), as the 2013 decision amends it` and §7(ח)'s).
@ref akn:art_15__para_a akn:art_15__para_b
GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher joining under the 2013 decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an intern with a degree, by section 15 of the 2013 decision` t IF
    t's `in an internship year` AND (t's `qualifications`)'s `holds an academic degree`

GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher joining under the 2013 decision`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 7(ח)(2)(ד) saves an intern` t IF
    `an intern with a degree, by section 15 of the 2013 decision` t

-- (ג): after §16(ג) comes (ד): (א)–(ג) apply to a teaching employee in his
-- internship year, but the values of the Oz LaTmura supplement, the 1987
-- supplement and the 1994 supplement are 90% of their values under them.
-- (ד): §28 is marked (א), and after it (ב) says the same of part
-- application. "ערכיהן ... לפי הסעיפים-הקטנים האמורים" of the 1987 and 1994
-- supplements is the whole supplement as §16(ג) or §28 leaves it, or only
-- the increase they make (F-oz-higui-2013-e): the reading adopted, as
-- printed (convention reading.as-printed), is 90% of the whole value the
-- sub-sections give. Undated: from the decision's day.
@ref akn:art_15__para_c akn:art_15__para_d
`an intern's share of the Oz supplements by the 2013 decision` MEANS 90%

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `in an internship year` IS A BOOLEAN, `the value without section 15` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `an Oz supplement's value under section 15 of the 2013 decision on` d `in an internship year` `the value without section 15` IS
    IF `in an internship year` AND `an undated section of the 2013 decision governs on` d
    THEN `an intern's share of the Oz supplements by the 2013 decision` TIMES `the value without section 15`
    ELSE `the value without section 15`

-- §16(ד): an intern in full application.
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `in an internship year` IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `the 2001 supplement` IS A NUMBER, `the 2008 supplement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement, as the 2013 decision amends section 16, on` d `in an internship year` e `the combined salary` `the 2001 supplement` `the 2008 supplement` IS
    `an Oz supplement's value under section 15 of the 2013 decision on` d `in an internship year`
        (`the Oz LaTmura supplement for` e `the combined salary` `the 2001 supplement` `the 2008 supplement`)

GIVEN d IS A DATE, `in an internship year` IS A BOOLEAN, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the supplement without the increase` IS A NUMBER, `its value on the eve of the signing` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1987 or 1994 supplement, as the 2013 decision amends section 16, on` d `in an internship year` e `the supplement without the increase` `its value on the eve of the signing` IS
    `an Oz supplement's value under section 15 of the 2013 decision on` d `in an internship year`
        (`the 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 16(ג)` e `the supplement without the increase` `its value on the eve of the signing`)

-- §28(ב): an intern in part application. A teacher in part application is
-- an existing one (§26's opening leaves new teachers out), and an intern
-- may be one (§4(ג)(2) counts no internship year, but other years).
GIVEN d IS A DATE, `in an internship year` IS A BOOLEAN, y IS A NUMBER, m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the combined salary` IS A NUMBER, `the 2001 supplement` IS A NUMBER, `the 2008 supplement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz LaTmura supplement in part application, as the 2013 decision amends section 28, on` d `in an internship year` y m e `the combined salary` `the 2001 supplement` `the 2008 supplement` IS
    `an Oz supplement's value under section 15 of the 2013 decision on` d `in an internship year`
        (`the Oz LaTmura supplement under section 28` y m e `the combined salary` `the 2001 supplement` `the 2008 supplement`)

§§ `16 המענק החד פעמי — שהיה בשבתון בתקופה הקובעת`

-- In place of §40(ה): one under (א) who was on sabbatical for the whole
-- determining period, or for part of it and employed continuously by the
-- employer in the rest, is entitled to the one-time grant. The grant was
-- for 1.9.2010–1.1.2011 and paid in 2011 (§40(ח)); the section speaks of
-- that period and reaches back to it. It writes into (ה) the case §40 left
-- out (F-oz-founding-40-a). §40's other rules are imported.
@ref akn:art_16/p1
GIVEN e IS AN `Oz section 40 employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the section 40 grant, as the 2013 decision amends (ה)` e IF
    IF e's `on unpaid leave or absent as on unpaid leave in the determining period`
    THEN `section 40(ז) entitles one on unpaid leave` e
    ELSE e's `employed throughout the determining period` OR e's `on sabbatical for the whole determining period`

GIVEN e IS AN `Oz section 40 employee`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the section 40 grant, as the 2013 decision amends (ה)` e IS
    IF `entitled to the section 40 grant, as the 2013 decision amends (ה)` e
    THEN `the section 40 grant for a full position` TIMES `the position share section 40(ב) pays on` e
    ELSE 0

§§ `17 הפרשות בגין שכר מעבר ל – 100% משרה`

-- After §46(ו) comes (ז): "מובהר" that the rates of contributions on pay
-- for work beyond a full position did not change from the collective
-- agreements of the eve of the signing. Its words speak of the time since
-- the signing ("לא חל כל שינוי"): it reaches back to §46's own day,
-- 1.9.2011. §46(א) (imported) would otherwise bring that pay in at the
-- rates customary for pension components.
@ref akn:art_17/p1
DECLARE `what sets the contributions on pay beyond a full position` IS ONE OF
    `section 46's rates for pension components`
    `the collective agreements of the eve of the signing, unchanged`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE `what sets the contributions on pay beyond a full position`
DECIDE `what sets the contributions on pay beyond a full position, by the 2013 decision, on` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` `section 46 applies from`
    THEN JUST `the collective agreements of the eve of the signing, unchanged`
    ELSE NOTHING

`why the rates on pay beyond a full position are not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "שיעורי ההפרשות בגין שכר עבור עבודה מעבר ל־100% משרה, לפי ההסכמים הקיבוציים שהיו קיימים ערב חתימת הסכם עוז לתמורה (13.8.2011)"

§§ `18 הצטרפות עובדי ההוראה המלמדים בכיתות י"ג–י"ד לרפורמה`

-- ¶1: notwithstanding §§5–7, teaching employees who teach grades 13–14 join
-- the reform only in תשע"ה; until it opens: (א) one who teaches both grades
-- 13–14 and lower upper-division grades and joined is on the reform's
-- terms for the position he holds in grades 12 and below, and off them for
-- the position in grades 13–14; (ב) notwithstanding (א), his hours in
-- grades 13–14 count both toward the threshold of a least position for
-- joining (§§6(ב) and 7(ח): `qualifications` above takes his whole
-- position) and toward the frontal hours a role holder teaches (§17(ד)).
-- The section names the time it covers, to the opening of תשע"ה.
@ref akn:art_18/p1 akn:art_18__para_a
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
      `position in grades 12 and below` IS A NUMBER
      `position in grades 13 and 14` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position on the reform's terms, by section 18 of the 2013 decision, in` y `position in grades 12 and below` `position in grades 13 and 14` IS
    IF y LESS THAN `the school year 5775`
    THEN `position in grades 12 and below`
    ELSE `position in grades 12 and below` PLUS `position in grades 13 and 14`

@ref akn:art_18__para_b
GIVEN `frontal hours in grades 12 and below` IS A NUMBER, `frontal hours in grades 13 and 14` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the frontal hours that count toward section 17(ד), by section 18 of the 2013 decision` `frontal hours in grades 12 and below` `frontal hours in grades 13 and 14` IS
    `frontal hours in grades 12 and below` PLUS `frontal hours in grades 13 and 14`

§§ `19 תוספת 87' ותוספת 94'`

-- (א): at the end of §28(א): the increase of the 1987 and 1994 supplements
-- under §16(ג) is, it too, at the rates of §28. This is the reading
-- F-oz-founding-28-a took of §28 as signed; the decision writes it in, and
-- §28's rule (imported) is the rule. No day is needed: the rule is the
-- same before it and after.
@ref akn:art_19__para_a
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A `Oz staff member`, e IS A `extent of the Oz reform`
      `the supplement without the increase` IS A NUMBER
      `its value on the eve of the signing` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the 1987 or 1994 supplement in part application, as the 2013 decision amends section 28(א)` y m e `the supplement without the increase` `its value on the eve of the signing` IS
    `the 1987 or 1994 supplement under section 28` y m e `the supplement without the increase` `its value on the eve of the signing`

-- (ב): the table of the shekel values of the 1987 and 1994 supplements in
-- each of תשע"ב–תשע"ה, as on the decision's day, "is attached as annex
-- ______"; the number is blank (the corpus marks it as printed) and no
-- table is attached to the decision as the corpus holds it. The values are
-- the supplements as the rules above compute them.
@ref akn:art_19__para_b
`why the table of section 19(ב) has no figures here` MEANS
    `the text is missing` "טבלת הערכים השקליים של תוספת 87' ותוספת 94' בשנות הלימודים תשע\"ב–תשע\"ה, שסעיף 19(ב) אומר שהיא מצורפת כנספח שמספרו ריק: ההחלטה כפי שהקורפוס מחזיק אותה (8 עמודים) אינה כוללת אותה"

