§§ `דוגמאות`

`a teacher of mathematics joining in 5774` MEANS
    `Oz teacher joining under the 2013 decision` WITH
        `qualifications`                                   IS `the qualifications of a teacher at` 0.25 TRUE TRUE FALSE
        `an existing teaching employee`                    IS TRUE
        `the school year of joining`                       IS `the school year 5774`
        `upper-division position in the year before joining` IS 0.4
        `upper-division position in the year of joining`   IS 0.25
        `holds a doctorate`                                IS FALSE
        `the subject he teaches in the upper division`     IS `mathematics`
        `in an internship year`                            IS FALSE
        `lacks a licence only for want of a teaching certificate` IS FALSE
        `held on the eve of the year a permit letter from the teaching personnel division` IS FALSE
        `registered on the eve of the year for the studies the letter sets` IS FALSE
        `signed on the eve of the year the commitment to complete them in three years` IS FALSE

