GIVETH AN `Oz teacher joining under the 2013 decision`
DECIDE `a full-time teacher joining in` y existing licence doctor subject intern letter IS
    `Oz teacher joining under the 2013 decision` WITH
        `qualifications`                                   IS `the qualifications of a teacher at` 1 licence TRUE FALSE
        `an existing teaching employee`                    IS existing
        `the school year of joining`                       IS y
        `upper-division position in the year before joining` IS 1
        `upper-division position in the year of joining`   IS 1
        `holds a doctorate`                                IS doctor
        `the subject he teaches in the upper division`     IS subject
        `in an internship year`                            IS intern
        `lacks a licence only for want of a teaching certificate` IS NOT licence
        `held on the eve of the year a permit letter from the teaching personnel division` IS letter
        `registered on the eve of the year for the studies the letter sets` IS letter
        `signed on the eve of the year the commitment to complete them in three years` IS letter

