-- §§13–14: each mother's cap is the year's greatest position plus §26(ה)'s step
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, approved IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a mother's cap is the greatest position plus the step in` y approved IF
    `a mother's cap in part application, as the 2013 decision amends section 26, in` y approved
        EQUALS JUST (most PLUS step)
    WHERE
        most MEANS fromMaybe 0 (`the most a teacher in part application may be employed at, as the 2013 decision amends section 27, in` y approved)
        step MEANS fromMaybe 0 (`the rate section 26(ה) puts in place of 7% in` y)

